  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">/code-review + /adr-check run; no unresolved criticals (or issues filed).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">/test-diet report exists and is cited; reviewer-approved deletions applied.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Both deferrals are filed as tracked issues.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">README + plan are Complete with graduation criteria checked; lessons-learned appended; /devops-project-sync run.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Mandatory final task. R1.5 is NOT decomposed here — only its spec-pass follow-on is filed.
  </notes>

  <execution>
